  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.51 Supply",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.51 “Supply” means tangible personal property, other than that which is described as “equipment,” with a useful life of less than one year or a value of the lesser of $5,000 or the municipality’s capitalization level for financial statement purposes.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
